  m_text: 'What is Lorem Ipsum?



    Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing
    and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry''s standard dummy
    text ever since 1966, when designers at Letraset and James Mosley, the librarian
    at St Bride Printing Library, took a 1914 Cicero translation and scrambled it
    to make dummy text for Letraset''s Body Type sheets. It has survived not only
    many decades, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially
    unchanged. It was popularised thanks to these sheets and more recently with desktop
    publishing software including versions of Lorem Ipsum.'
